{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f5142cb3ab7ac42c330c","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197844,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be silence.\"\n\nThe system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I need to be silence. What does silence say or express? Nothing. Silence is the absence of speech, the absence of expression through words.\n\nThe most authentic embodiment of silence would be... no output at all. Or perhaps the most minimal possible response.\n\nBut I need to output something as Claude"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}